1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,783
If the volume cannot change, no expansion work can be done, so all the heat goes into internal energy.

2
00:00:06,783 --> 00:00:09,856
q at constant volume equals delta U.

3
00:00:09,856 --> 00:00:17,838
That is why combustion energies are measured in a bomb calorimeter, a sealed steel vessel of fixed volume, sitting in water.

